            "detailed_description": "King of the Road is back! Trucker 2 lets you sit once again behind the wheel of a truck and race on American highways.<br>Player can choose order of his missions. There are nearly 60 of them. You can chose one of 5 different trucks which can be upgraded and modified in your garage. Road's surroundings are destructible, and the damage is visible on cars. Damage affects car handling.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>60 levels<br></li><li>5 different types of trucks<br></li><li>3 difficulty levels<br></li><li>realistic physic based on Nvidia PhysX engine<br></li><li>visible car damage<br></li><li>Large, beautiful locations<br></li><li>Tuning<br></li><li>Varying day time and weather conditions<br></li><li>Power-ups<br></li><li>Traffic and police<br></li><li>ability to use custom textures and HUD<br></li><li>steering wheels and game pad support</li></ul>",
